flowchart TD
    Crash[Process or filesystem interruption] --> Source{SQLite source mutation committed?}
    Source -- No --> Request[Caller retries request]
    Source -- Yes --> Manifest{Valid active manifest and generation?}
    Manifest -- Yes --> Load[Load published snapshot]
    Manifest -- No --> Rebuild[Rebuild active index from non-deleted SQLite documents]
    Load --> Ready[Expose readiness]
    Rebuild --> Publish[Write recovered generation and manifest]
    Publish --> Ready
    Request --> Ready

    Jobs[Phase 2 pending or processing jobs] -. future .-> Replay[Claim/retry after restart]
